From 3693a4a14135e03ee9fdee2ca3126c37f7a2d405 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:36:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] nuhome2 v34: parking sign, live divert to the back lot,
 signal and camera fixes

- Parallel park: right signal goes off as the car starts its left swing into the space
- New PARKING sign in the EXIT sign's spot; sends the car to the back lot
- Pressed during the opening drive: car carries on past the aisle (live drive, same position/heading/speed); once it has turned into the aisle it parks first, then drives out
- Reverse-park drives end on a camera that shows the next "!" (checked by projection on 7 screen sizes)
- Chained entry modes (parallelE, bayE); check-park and new check-enter scripts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UganUXFhNd5M1gKdckBG4L
